WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.939
Two defenders can reach the ball.

2
00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:06.579
Clear communication keeps the play organized.

3
00:00:07.059 --> 00:00:11.381
In this example, the closer player calls: I got it!

4
00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:16.168
The teammate hears the call and moves behind to back up.

5
00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:22.295
On a pop-up, listen to the call and your coach's priority system.

6
00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:25.304
One player catches or fields.

7
00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:27.951
Everyone else still has a job.

8
00:00:28.431 --> 00:00:33.138
Use a loud voice, keep watching the ball, and help your teammate.
